00:00:26.227 --> 00:00:26.934
and a ten

00:00:26.746 --> 00:00:28.208
thousand image dataset

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.128
idles at around

00:00:28.939 --> 00:00:30.165
20 megabytes of

00:00:29.977 --> 00:00:30.672
memory

